## Invent A — secret element → list_get → sink (must refuse)
```
// SECRET: api_key
pub fn main() {
    let api_key = "s3cret";
    let mut xs: List[String] = list_new();
    xs = list_push(xs, api_key);
    let y = list_get(xs, 0);
    println(y);
}
```
